  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Made to Fit physical-product workbench",
    "overview": "Made to Fit extends its existing physical-product studio under the user's white-and-orange direction. Graphite and ivory frame the home page; white grounds project workspaces and the 3D viewer. Orange gives actions and current selection a consistent voice across both themes. Authentic uploaded photos, their reviewed crops and actual geometry carry the visual interest.\n\nThe interface is practical and spacious: plain task headings, rounded controls, divided lists and pale tonal groups help a hobbyist move from loose hardware to a printable build. Suggested identity, appearance, measured fit and accepted geometry remain visibly distinct. This records the finished implementation, not a seed or a newly invented visual world; no random concept roll or new raster artwork was produced by this redesign.",
